Bootstrap: localimage
From: /home/mtdsn/Optimization_Framework/containers/dolfinx_v0.9.0.sif

%post
    # Update pip
    python3 -m pip install --upgrade pip

    # Install PyVista (for VTK file reading)
    # PyVista requires vtk, which will be installed as a dependency
    python3 -m pip install pyvista scipy

    # Verify installation
    python3 -c "import pyvista as pv; print(f'PyVista {pv.__version__} installed successfully')"
    python3 -c "import scipy; print(f'SciPy {scipy.__version__} installed successfully')"

%environment
    # No additional environment variables needed - PyVista will be in Python path

%labels
    Author mnakamura
    Version 0.9.0-pyvista
    Description "DOLFINx 0.9.0 container with PyVista for VTK file reading"

%help
    This is a DOLFINx 0.9.0 container extended with PyVista for robust VTK file reading.

    PyVista provides better support for reading VTU/PVTU files of all versions.

    Usage:
        singularity exec dolfinx_v0.9.0_pyvista.sif python3 your_script.py

    To verify PyVista is available:
        singularity exec dolfinx_v0.9.0_pyvista.sif python3 -c "import pyvista; print(pyvista.__version__)"
